OL,3,ACould this be the last Bonfire Night
OL,4,Afor noisy fireworks?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBangers, rockets and screamers have
OL,7,Flong been part of Bonfire Night - but
OL,8,Fthe traditional celebrations might
OL,9,Fsound a little different next year.
OL,11,FThe government is currently considering
OL,12,Freducing the noise limit for fireworks
OL,13,Fby 50% for those bought in shops for
OL,14,Fprivate use, after pressure from
OL,15,Fcampaigners concerned about the impact
OL,16,Fon nervous animals and people with Post
OL,17,FTraumatic Stress Disorder (PTSD).
OL,19,FProfessionally organised displays would
OL,20,Fcontinue to have no maximum limit
OL,21,Fprovided the noise level is not harmful
OL,22,Fto human health.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
